1163
01:20:30.507 --> 01:20:32.225
And neither will I.

1164
01:20:40.335 --> 01:20:45.113
Y'all should've taken my deal. 
Now you will spend the rest of your life

1165
01:20:45.114 --> 01:20:47.600
bein' a slimy little frog!

1166
01:20:48.272 --> 01:20:51.132
I got news for you, Shadow Man! 

1167
01:20:51.133 --> 01:20:53.653
It's not slime, it's mucus!

1168
01:20:56.972 --> 01:20:58.880
No! No!

1169
01:21:00.775 --> 01:21:03.762
How am I ever gonna pay back my debt?! 

1170
01:21:05.884 --> 01:21:09.012
<i> - Friends! 
- Are you ready? </i>

1171
01:21:09.405 --> 01:21:14.628
<i> - No! I'm not ready at all! In fact, I got lots more plans!
- Are you ready? </i>

1172
01:21:14.629 --> 01:21:17.952
This is just a minor setback in a major operation! 

1173
01:21:18.615 --> 01:21:21.584
As soon as I whip up another spell, 
we'll be back in business! 

1174
01:21:21.795 --> 01:21:24.393
I still got that froggy prince locked away!

1175
01:21:24.934 --> 01:21:27.707
I just need a little more time.

1176
01:21:28.273 --> 01:21:29.997
No! No, please, no! 

1177
01:21:31.809 --> 01:21:33.179
Just a little more time!

1178
01:21:35.500 --> 01:21:38.570
I promise I'll pay y'all back! I promise! 

1179
01:21:54.087 --> 01:21:56.777
<i> Prince! Prince Naveen </i>

1180
01:21:57.143 --> 01:22:00.976
Your shini', retirin' bride, 
completely is gettin' anxiety.

1181
01:22:03.357 --> 01:22:05.585
Hello, darling!

1182
01:22:08.135 --> 01:22:09.734
<i> Miss La Bouff </i>

1183
01:22:10.066 --> 01:22:11.366
<i> Please down here. </i>

1184
01:22:12.136 --> 01:22:16.885
Let me to introduce myself.
I am the real Prince Naveen!

1185
01:22:18.237 --> 01:22:20.119
Of Maldonia.

1186
01:22:20.812 --> 01:22:22.673
Did you say prince?

1187
01:22:24.899 --> 01:22:29.257
- Boys, drag this maggot down to the Parish prison.
- I'm completely innocent.

1188
01:22:29.258 --> 01:22:30.932
The Shadow Man bamboozled me.

1189
01:22:31.563 --> 01:22:34.693
Goodness gracious! 
This is so much to absorb.

1190
01:22:34.728 --> 01:22:36.153
Let me see if I got this right.

1191
01:22:36.760 --> 01:22:40.883
If I kiss you before midnight,
you and Tiana will turn human again,

1192
01:22:40.884 --> 01:22:44.756
and then we gonna get ourselves married 
and live happily ever after!

1193
01:22:44.757 --> 01:22:47.051
- The end! 
- Yeah, more or less.

1194
01:22:47.052 --> 01:22:51.830
But remember, you must give Tiana all 
the money she requires for her restaurant. 

1195
01:22:52.047 --> 01:22:53.573
Because Tiana ...

1196
01:22:56.773 --> 01:22:58.679
She is my Evangeline. 

1197
01:23:00.535 --> 01:23:02.328
Anything you want, sugar. 

1198
01:23:03.485 --> 01:23:05.228
Pucker up, buttercup! 

1199
01:23:08.379 --> 01:23:09.979
<i> - Wait!
- Tiana? </i>

1200
01:23:10.392 --> 01:23:12.485
- Tiana?
- Don't do this. 

1201
01:23:12.599 --> 01:23:14.702
I have to do this and we are running out of time! 

1202
01:23:14.703 --> 01:23:17.651
- I won't let you! 
- It's the only way to get you your dream! 

1203
01:23:18.176 --> 01:23:19.585
My dream?

1204
01:23:20.015 --> 01:23:21.901
My dream wouldn't be complete...

1205
01:23:22.747 --> 01:23:24.168
Without you in it.

1206
01:23:28.493 --> 01:23:29.985
I love you, Naveen.

1207
01:23:34.605 --> 01:23:37.903
- Warts and all? 
- Warts and all. 

1208
01:23:43.495 --> 01:23:47.909
All my life, I read about true love and fairytales, and... 

1209
01:23:49.069 --> 01:23:52.174
Tia, you found it!

1210
01:23:53.858 --> 01:23:56.730
I'll kiss him! For you, honey! 

1211
01:23:56.902 --> 01:23:58.985
No marriage required. 

1212
01:24:02.270 --> 01:24:03.828
Oh my word! 

1213
01:24:03.941 --> 01:24:06.611
M-maybe that ol' clock's a little fast! 

1214
01:24:15.923 --> 01:24:17.594
I'm so sorry! 

1215
01:24:19.781 --> 01:24:22.182
<i> Tiana! Naveen! </i>

1216
01:24:25.096 --> 01:24:26.610
Louis, what is it?

1217
01:24:26.645 --> 01:24:29.732
- Shadow Man laid poor Ray low!
- Ray?

1218
01:24:29.733 --> 01:24:31.746
He's hurtin' awful bad.

1219
01:24:47.278 --> 01:24:48.778
Hey, sug'!

1220
01:24:49.295 --> 01:24:53.888
- How come, y'all still ...
- We are stayin' frogs, Ray.

1221
01:24:53.889 --> 01:24:55.805
And we are stayin' together.

1222
01:24:58.311 --> 01:25:02.004
Oh, I like that very much.

1223
01:25:04.399 --> 01:25:07.645
Evangeline like that too.

1224
01:27:07.449 --> 01:27:10.770
So, by the power invested in me ...

1225
01:27:12.360 --> 01:27:16.793
I now pronounce you frog and wife.

1226
01:27:16.983 --> 01:27:20.952
Get to it, Hop Lone,
and give your lovely bride some sugar.

1227
01:27:20.953 --> 01:27:22.307
Congratulations!

1228
01:27:36.001 --> 01:27:38.133
This gonna be good!

1229
01:28:06.642 --> 01:28:10.849
Like I told y'all, kissing a princess
brake the spell.

1230
01:28:10.850 --> 01:28:14.291
Once you became my wife,
that made you ...

1231
01:28:14.292 --> 01:28:15.740
A princess.

1232
01:28:15.775 --> 01:28:18.619
You just kissed yourself a princess! 

1233
01:28:18.620 --> 01:28:21.435
And I'm about to do it again! 

1234
01:29:18.017 --> 01:29:19.487
<i> In the South Land there's </i>

1235
01:29:19.522 --> 01:29:20.957
<i> A city </i>

1236
01:29:21.553 --> 01:29:23.595
<i> Way down on the river </i>

1237
01:29:24.428 --> 01:29:27.500
<i> Where the women are very pretty </i>

1238
01:29:27.502 --> 01:29:30.228
<i> And all the men deliver </i>

1239
01:29:31.003 --> 01:29:33.985
<i> They got music 
It's always playin' </i>

1240
01:29:34.190 --> 01:29:37.117
<i> Start in the day time, go all through the night </i>

1241
01:29:37.332 --> 01:29:40.353
<i> When you hear that music playin' </i>

1242
01:29:40.388 --> 01:29:43.375
<i> Hear what I'm saying and make it feel alright </i>

1243
01:29:44.062 --> 01:29:46.829
Who would've thought the prince 
woulda had a younger brother.

1244
01:29:47.903 --> 01:29:51.778
- How old did you say you were? 
- I'm six and a half. 

1245
01:29:53.090 --> 01:29:55.765
Well, I waited this long.

1246
01:29:56.667 --> 01:29:59.333
<i> Grab somebody, come on down </i>

1247
01:30:00.022 --> 01:30:02.790
<i> Bring your paintbrush, we're painting the town </i>

1248
01:30:03.068 --> 01:30:07.139
<i> There's some sweetness going around </i>

1249
01:30:08.074 --> 01:30:22.990
<i> Dreams do come true in New Orleans. </i>

1250
01:30:23.074 --> 01:30:28.990
By radojka, january 2010
